  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Justice and Security in SWS: Capacitating State Infrastructures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to assist both the Ministries of Justice and Internal Security in SWS by constructing office headquarters in Baidoa, SWS. IOM is committed to fostering sustainable development and advancing stability in the region, acknowledging the crucial role of proper infrastructure in facilitating effective governance. A well-equipped infrastructure creates an environment where Ministry officials can efficiently execute their duties. It enables better resource organization, streamlines processes, and enhances accessibility for both staff and citizens in need of services. Investment in infrastructure reflects a dedication to enhancing public services, positively influencing the community&apos;s perception of the Ministries. This fosters trust and encourages increased engagement with the justice and security system when required.</narrative>
  </description>
